{14}{Lifte Fork? [He looks questioningly at the others] Unless maybe he was talking about the Jxoid Cut. Ages ago there was a place along the road where they used a crane to lift your wagons to the top of a cliff but then they carved a trail to get you to the top. Nobody calls it the Lifte anymore.}{Lifte Fork? [He looks questioningly at the others] Unless maybe he was talking about the Jxoid Cut. Ages ago there was a place along the road where they used a crane to lift your wagons to the top of a cliff but then they carved a trail to get you to the top. Nobody calls it the Lifte anymore.}{}{}{}{}
{15}{Well, that certainly explains that mix-up.}{}{5}{}{17}{}
