{17}{Yes, it certainly does. I know ol' Phineas thinks I'm a little drafty between the ears but you gotta have some smarts for this kinda adventuring... Life.... Thing! [He gives a decisive nod to emphasize his point]}{Yes, it certainly does. I know ol' Phineas thinks I'm a little drafty between the ears but you gotta have some smarts for this kinda adventuring... Life.... Thing! [He gives a decisive nod to emphasize his point]}{}{}{}{}
